00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:27.460
And I would say, "What, what does she do?"

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:30.870
And they would say, "What
do you mean she's Angelyne?"

00:05:30.870 --> 00:05:33.760
So, and the more I kind of
got fixated on this idea,

00:05:33.760 --> 00:05:36.740
