00:05:56.670 --> 00:05:58.780
Or she'll, you can buy a ride along,

00:05:58.780 --> 00:05:59.760
where you get in her car

00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:01.780
and like, drive around the block with her.

00:06:01.780 --> 00:06:04.630
And she represents kind of, hot pink

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:06.940
and good luck and positivity.

00:06:06.940 --> 00:06:10.110
And she kind of roared
into L.A. and took it over.

00:06:10.110 --> 00:06:13.420
She was kind of like, she's a
living, breathing work of art.

00:06:13.420 --> 00:06:15.240
And she's kind of curated
her life that way,

00:06:15.240 --> 00:06:17.373
she kind of, was Instagram
before Instagram.

00:06:17.373 --> 00:06:19.500
- I was going to say like an
influencer, almost before.

00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:21.070
- [Emmy] Yeah, she kind of invented that.

00:06:21.070 --> 00:06:22.050
She...
- Yeah.

00:06:22.050 --> 00:06:24.450
- Kind of, came up with this identity

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:28.160
and chose it for herself and
she lives that every day.

00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:30.720
And I think she's kind of incredible.

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:32.880
- It's in, it's very
interesting, the character,

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:34.230
because I was like, "Wow".

00:06:34.230 --> 00:06:36.500
Even how she talks to the, I
don't want to ruin anything,

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:39.710
but even how her relationship
with the guy and the band,

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:41.910
like all this stuff, like how she kind of,

00:06:41.910 --> 00:06:43.170
and then I love how it's like,

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:44.910
how one person sees a situation

00:06:44.910 --> 00:06:47.000
and the other one is like,
"That's not how it happened".

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:48.480
And then, you see the same situation,

00:06:48.480 --> 00:06:50.598
but it's completely different
in how people remember it.

00:06:50.598 --> 00:06:51.431
- Well, that's what I
thought was so interesting

00:06:51.431 --> 00:06:53.280
about all the stories that
I had heard about her,

00:06:53.280 --> 00:06:55.010
where they were wildly contradictory.

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:58.360
And I started thinking about how fame is,

00:06:58.360 --> 00:07:01.330
like a fame machine and
how an icon is built.

00:07:01.330 --> 00:07:02.590
Like the mythology of that,

00:07:02.590 --> 00:07:05.460
how you have all these
contradicting narratives

00:07:05.460 --> 00:07:08.010
about where somebody's
from or what they represent

00:07:08.010 --> 00:07:09.670
or who they really are.

00:07:09.670 --> 00:07:13.830
And, and to kind of,
juxtapose all of those

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:16.970
and show that there is no
one real truth to anything,

00:07:16.970 --> 00:07:18.930
is kind of, really interesting.

00:07:18.930 --> 00:07:21.240
- Yeah and how many truths
there are out there,

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:22.740
because you don't know the real one.

00:07:22.740 --> 00:07:25.810
So, my favorite part though,
