00:08:20.128 --> 00:08:21.223
and how she kind of,

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:25.940
uses her kind of, femininity

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:29.550
and her sexuality to get people off guard.

00:08:29.550 --> 00:08:30.974
- [Kelly] Yeah, oh she does, yeah.

00:08:30.974 --> 00:08:31.807
- [Emmy] And to have the upper hand

